package CanvasNet {
    part def ScadDocument {
        doc /* The public API of CanvasNetScad in the DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad namespace: the sealed, immutable, thread-safe ScadDocument with the static Parse(string), Open(string path), and Open(Stream) entry points (UTF-8 with byte-order-mark detection, source limited to 4,194,304 characters, the stream left open and a non-terminating stream bounded), the SourceName, Directives (file-scope include/use directives in source order, recorded and never resolved while parsing), ModuleNames, and FunctionNames (file-scope definitions in source order, duplicates kept) properties, the Evaluate method that evaluates the document headlessly and returns a ScadEvaluationResult (echo lines, diagnostics, unsupported-feature reports, instance count), the BuildScene method that evaluates the document and builds a Render3D Scene of its geometry, and the Render method that draws that scene onto a new Surface (a fitted isometric view by default, or a caller-supplied camera; invalid size or camera rejected before any evaluation; events of all stages delivered once, in order, on the calling thread; cancellation honored; byte-identical images from repeated and concurrent calls); the immutable, validated ScadOpenOptions (BaseDirectory, LibraryPaths, FileResolver, SourceName), ScadEvaluationOptions (Variables, Time, Limits, handlers, ThrowOnUnsupportedFeature), and ScadRenderOptions (Evaluation, Camera, ViewAzimuthDegrees, ViewElevationDegrees, Projection, SceneOptions, FlatShapeThickness); the ScadLimits resource limits, including the MaxTriangles limit on generated geometry; the ScadSourceLocation record struct (file, one-based line and column); the ScadSyntaxException (a FormatException carrying the Location of the first syntax error), the ScadEvaluationException (an InvalidOperationException carrying the Location of a failed evaluation), and the ScadUnsupportedFeatureException (an IOException carrying the feature and location); the ScadDiagnostic and ScadUnsupportedFeature records; and the ScadDirective record with its ScadDirectiveKind enumeration. It delegates all lexing and parsing to the internal ScadLanguage subsystem, all evaluation to the internal ScadEvaluation subsystem, and all geometry building to the internal ScadGeometry subsystem and the Render3D renderer, and opens no file while parsing. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadDocument.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadOpenOptions.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadSourceLocation.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadSyntaxException.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadDirective.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadDirectiveKind.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadDocument.Evaluate.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadDocument.Render.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadRenderOptions.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadEvaluationOptions.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadEvaluationResult.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadLimits.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadDiagnostic.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadUnsupportedFeature.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadUnsupportedFeatureException.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/ScadEvaluationException.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Scad/NamespaceDoc.cs */
